    {
      "body": "The chained-vs-sequential test validates the block math, but it manually drives the chain and does not cover `WanTransformer3DModel.forward()` selecting this branch. Could you add a small model-level test for the dispatch and assert that wrappers/adapters or a non-CUDA kernel path keep the original block-by-block behavior? That would cover the integration and the fallback boundary where behavior could otherwise change.",
